== Description ==
The upgraded version of [[Pixie]], with increased click profits and summoning efficiency based on level.

Gains [[Experience#Pet Experience|experience]] through his autoclicks, even when offline.

Easier unlock: Use the [[Void Milking]] challenge.

== Pet Abilities ==

Autoclicks:
* <math>1 + \left\lfloor\frac{L}{20}\right\rfloor</math> times per second
* with <math>\text{Click Profit}\ =\ 2^N \times \text{Hero Click Profit}</math>
* with <math>\text{Crit Chance}\ =\ \text{Hero Crit Chance}</math>
* with <math>\text{Crit Profit}\ =\ \text{Hero Crit Profit}</math><br><br>
Multiplies Click Profit by:
<br><math>2^{L/24} \times P^{0.85} \times L \times 12.5 + 1</math>


Multiplies Summoning efficiency by:
<br><math>\left(\frac{L}{2} \times P^{0.3} + 1 \right)^{0.5} + 1</math>


where:
* <math>L = \text{Pet Level}</math>
* <math>N = \text{Active Summoning Spells}</math>
* <math>P = \text{Pet Ability Power}</math>

== Experience Gain ==
Gains experience from his autoclicks, earning this amount per click:
<br><math>(1 + F) \times M</math>
<br>where:
*<math>F = \text{Fixed Pet XP Bonus}</math>
*<math>M = \text{Pet XP Multiplier}</math>

